; ==============================================================================
;  config\menus\media.rc  -  shared by the themes; no look here (icons come from variables
;  each theme defines: none; empty = no icon).
;  Player controls; they follow the player chosen with !MediaPlayerNext (Core). For *Popup menus only (no start menu uses it).
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it. Menus cannot be extended
;  from personal.rc (it is read before the theme; see AGENTS.md section 5).
; ==============================================================================
*Popup "$TxtPrevious$" !MediaPrev
*Popup "$TxtPlayPause$" !MediaPlayPause
*Popup "$TxtNext$" !MediaNext
